# Records assets/demo.gif for the README.
# Needs: vhs, ttyd, ffmpeg, and `pacclean` on your PATH (run `npm link` first).
# Run:   vhs demo.tape

Output assets/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 12
Set Width 1200
Set Height 500
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set Padding 10

Type "pacclean --test --speed fast"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 10s
